							<li>[PLACEHOLDER — Secondary education equivalent to 10+2 (High School Diploma or equivalent)]</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER — Minimum XXX% marks / GPA]</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER — English language proficiency proof (TOEFL/IELTS/equivalent)]</li>
							<li>[PLACEHOLDER — Degree recognition assessment from Tezpur University]</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="program-section">
						<h3>Visa & Documentation Requirements</h3>
