							<li><strong>Student Visa (India):</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — Category D for studies exceeding 6 months]</li>
							<li><strong>Passport:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — Minimum 6 months validity beyond program end date]</li>
							<li><strong>Proof of Funds:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — Evidence of financial support for tuition + living expenses]</li>
							<li><strong>Medical Fitness:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — Form 5A / Certified medical report]</li>
							<li><strong>Police Clearance:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — May be required by your country]</li>
							<li><strong>FRRO Registration:</strong> [PLACEHOLDER — Within 14 days of arrival in India]</li>
						</ul>
