					<div class="program-section">
						<h3>Application Process</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>Visit <strong>[PLACEHOLDER Tezpur University International Admissions Portal]</strong></li>
							<li>Select "B.Sc Physics"</li>
							<li>Complete the international application form with all details</li>
							<li>Upload required documents (certified copies/translations)</li>
							<li>Pay application fee: [PLACEHOLDER amount in USD/INR] (non-refundable)</li>
